        "text_AXtkTV": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>Annie’s Pooch Pops started over 20 years ago<\/strong> to provide the pet industry with a <strong>super-premium, gourmet treat<\/strong> that was healthy and aesthetically appealing to both pet and owner. <\/p><p>\n\n<\/p><p>The business started with humble roots in the family’s kitchen. As demand increased, Annie’s Pooch Pops rented a kitchen overnight from a local restaurant. Cooking from 10 p.m. to 6 a.m. wasn’t easy but eventually the business moved into its first dedicated facility, a 4,000 square foot barn in northern New Jersey horse country. In 2017, <strong>Annie’s Pooch Pops<\/strong> settled into a <strong>20,000 square human-grade food facility in Bangor, Pennsylvania.<\/strong><\/p>\n\n<p>Our promise to you and your pooch is to make the freshest, best looking, tastiest, handmade treats on the market.<\/p>",
